#. (itstool) path: page/title
#: C/limits.page:9
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "Avgrensingar"

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/limits.page:11
msgid ""
"Geary is still in early development. Geary supports IMAP and has been tested "
"with Gmail, Yahoo, and the free Dovecot mail server. Experimental support "
"for Outlook.com is provided. Geary may not yet work well with some IMAP "
"servers. At this time Geary is still missing numerous features including "
"offline mode."
msgstr ""
"Geary er framleis under tidleg utvikling. Geary støttar IMAP og er testa med"
" Gmail, Yahoo og den frie e-posttenaren Dovecot. Det finst eksperimentell "
"støtte for Outlook.com. Geary fungerer kanskje ikkje godt med alle IMAP-"
"tenarar enno. Førebels manglar Geary mange funksjonar, mellom anna frakopla "
"modus."

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/limits.page:17
msgid ""
"To learn more about the features we're working on and the future of Geary, "
"please visit Geary's <link href=\"https://wiki.gnome.org/Apps/Geary\">wiki "
"page</link>."
msgstr ""
"Du finn meir om funksjonane vi arbeider med og om framtida til Geary på "
