msgstr "Geary slettar utkastet når du sender meldinga."

#. (itstool) path: note/p
#: C/write.page:136
msgid ""
"If you save or discard a composed email, you can re-open it by clicking <gui "
"style=\"button\">Undo</gui> on the pop-up notification that appears or by "
